<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>The Vault is officially OPEN - Relisted</title>
  <style>
    * { box-sizing: border-box; }
    body {
      margin: 0;
      font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif;
      background-color: #f5f5f5;
      color: #111;
      padding: 24px;
      line-height: 1.5;
    }
    .wrapper {
      max-width: 520px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      background: #ffffff;
      border-radius: 12px;
      overflow: hidden;
      box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);
    }
    .header {
      background: #000;
      color: #fff;
      padding: 24px;
      text-align: center;
    }
    .header h1 {
      margin: 0;
      font-size: 1.25rem;
      font-weight: 600;
    }
    .content {
      padding: 32px 24px;
    }
    .content p {
      margin: 0 0 16px;
      color: #333;
    }
    .btn {
      display: inline-block;
      width: 100%;
      max-width: 280px;
      margin: 8px 0 8px;
      padding: 14px 24px;
      background: #000;
      color: #fff !important;
      text-decoration: none;
      font-weight: 600;
      font-size: 1rem;
      text-align: center;
      border-radius: 8px;
      border: none;
    }
    .text-link {
      color: #111;
      font-weight: 600;
      text-decoration: underline;
    }
    .note {
      font-size: 0.7rem;
      color: #f1f1f1;
      margin-top: 10px;
      text-align: center;
    }
    .callout {
      margin: 20px 0 16px;
      padding: 18px 20px;
      background: #f5f5f5;
      border-radius: 8px;
      border-left: 4px solid #000;
    }
    .callout p {
      margin: 0 0 10px;
      color: #333;
    }
    .callout p:last-child {
      margin-bottom: 0;
    }
    .callout-dates {
      font-size: 1.05rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: #111;
      letter-spacing: 0.02em;
    }
    .callout-tagline {
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      color: #444;
      margin-top: 4px !important;
    }
    .footer {
      padding: 20px 24px;
      font-size: 0.75rem;
      color: #888;
      text-align: center;
      border-top: 1px solid #eee;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="wrapper">
    <div class="header">
      <h1>The Vault is officially OPEN ✨</h1>
    </div>
    <div class="content">
      <p>Hi babe 💛,</p>
      <p>
        The wait is over.<strong> The Vault</strong> is officially <strong>LIVE</strong> ✨
      </p>
      <p>
        <strong>Your early access starts now</strong>, giving you first pick of the curated closets, designer finds, and unreal deals everyone's been waiting for 👀
      </p>
      <p>Shop now before the best pieces are gone</p>
      <p style="text-align: center;">
        <a href="{{shopUrl}}" class="btn">Shop now</a>
      </p>
      <div class="callout">
        <p style="margin-bottom: 8px;">
          The Vault will only be open for 48 hours
        </p>
        <p class="callout-dates">May 15th - May 17th</p>
        <p class="callout-tagline">
       <strong>Curated closets.</strong> <strong>Unreal prices.</strong> <strong>Gorgeous finds.</strong>
        </p>
      </div>
      <p>
        Happy shopping 🥂,<br />
        Team Relisted
      </p>
      <p class="note">
        You received this because you asked us to notify you about the Vault Closet sale on Relisted.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="footer">
      © {{currentYear}} Relisted. All rights reserved.<br />
      Buy. Sell. Relist with confidence.
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
